# Workspace-root .easignore for eas-cli's monorepo-mode clone.
#
# When eas-cli detects a monorepo (via pnpm-workspace.yaml here), it walks
# UP from apps/mobile/ to the workspace root and clones from there — so a
# project-scoped .easignore at apps/mobile/.easignore can't exclude paths
# OUTSIDE that dir. This file covers the workspace-root paths Replit
# clutters with sandbox state.
#
# Three failure modes this prevents (all hit during S0 init on Replit):
#   1. EACCES rmdir on .cache/dotslash/.../React Native DevTools-linux-x64
#      — dotslash unpacks binaries with 555 perms; cleanup fails.
#   2. Unknown system error -122 (filesystem error) copying .local/share/
#      pnpm/store/ — Replit puts the pnpm content-addressable store INSIDE
#      the workspace, so eas-cli tries to copy gigabytes of cached packages
#      into the shallow clone.
#   3. Replit-specific config (.replit, replit.nix, .config/) leaking into
#      mobile builds.

# ── pnpm + npm state (the -122 culprit) ─────────────────────────────
# (KEEP .npmrc — it sets node-linker=hoisted + shamefully-hoist=true which
#  Metro requires to find deep deps like whatwg-fetch from @expo/metro-runtime.
#  Without it, Android bundling fails with "Unable to resolve module" during
#  Prebuild on EAS's cloud runner. Caught at first production build.)
.local/
.npm/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ── Build caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
.expo/
.turbo/
.next/
.dotslash-cache/
.maestro-cache/
**/.cache/
**/.expo/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/

# ── Replit shell + config (the -122 + sandbox cruft) ────────────────
.config/
.sudo_motd
.eas-tmp/
.replit
replit.nix
.fork-config.json

# ── Editor + tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.claude.json
.agents/
.lefthook/
.mstack/
.github/
attached_assets/

# ── App scopes we don't want in the mobile bundle ───────────────────
# (KEEP packages/ — mobile imports @aira/api, @aira/config, @aira/validators
#  as workspace:* — excluding packages/ would break the monorepo dependency
#  resolution on EAS Build's cloud runner.)
# (KEEP tooling/ — packages/api, packages/config, packages/validators all
#  declare @aira/tsconfig as a workspace:* devDep; excluding tooling/ breaks
#  `pnpm install` on the cloud runner with an unresolved workspace dep,
#  surfacing as the iOS "Install dependencies" + Android "Prebuild"
#  failures from the first production run.)
apps/web/
docs/
scripts/

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Git state (eas-cli usually skips, but defensive) ────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
